 y\, Finland\, Latvia\, Lithuania\, Denmark\n(Norwegian\, English)\n\n𝗥
 𝗲𝗮𝗹𝗶𝘀𝗮𝘁𝗲𝘂𝗿 : Janicke Askevold\n𝗦𝗰𝗲
